GetFreeDiskSpace() is more than 0 = true
GetTotalDiskSpace() is more than 0 = true
GetFreeDiskSpace() is at most GetTotalDiskSpace() = true
GetLastModifiedDate(info.txt) is defined = true
GetLastModifiedDate(info.txt): GetYear() is 2025 or later = true
GetLastModifiedDate(missing.txt) is undefined = true
SetExecutable(true) on info.txt, then Exists() = true
SetExecutable(false) on info.txt, then Read() = [info]
